#######---
#### depth-space diags just passed into layers
#### "r": vertical; "l" for layers
#### ADV: adv 
#### DFrE: explicit, only from GM Kwx and Kwy when implicitDiffusion=T
#### DFrI: implicit: merged background/kpp plus GM Kwz if implicitDiffusion=T
#### DReE: the explicit part Redi part inside gad_calc_rhs ONLY for
####       implicitDiffusion=F. These were interpreted as "explicit" because
####       of the false above. Given that ASTE has implicitDiffusion=T,
####       I think the contrib of this "E" part from Kwz is zero (?)
#### DReI: Redi implicit (from Kwz) if implicitDiffusion=T
#### DBg[E,I]: background [ex,im]plicit
#### DKp[E,I]: KPP-only [ex,im]plicit
#### KPPg = non-local convective adjustment
####        uses diffusion coefficient of merged KPP/bg, excl Redi in ASTE
#### FrIE: explicit plus implicit (added INSIDE layers) 
