#
# HP ADDING DIAGNOSTICS FOR LAYERS PACKAGE
# SNATCHED FROM AN'S LAYERS ASTE270 RUN ON TACC
# An outputs everything in T-space, S-space and Sigma-space
# [LaUH, LaVH] is layer integrated transport (m^2/s)
# [LaUa, LaVa] is layer averaged [u,v] velocity 
# [LaHw, LaHs, LaHc ] is layer thickness at [U points (w=west), v points (s=south), tracer points (c=centre)]
# Ryan's added transformed tendencies:
# [LaTs, LaTh, LaTz] = layer THETA transform from [sfc forcing, horiz. diff, vert diff]
# [LTha, LTza, LTto] = layer THETA transform from [horiz. adv, vert adv, total tend]
# [LaSs, LaSh, LaSz] = as for [LaTs, LaTh, LaTz] but for salt
# [LSha, LSza, LSto] = as for [LTha, LTza, LTto] but for salt
# TO BE ABLE TO CONVERT BACK TO DENSITY COORDINATES, NEED TO DUMP SIGMA AT SAME FREQ ON Nr LEVELS...SO BE SURE TO INCLUDE:
# [LaTr]
# TO ALL OF THE ABOVE ADD THE EXTENSION 1SLT, 2TH, or 3RHO 
  frequency(23) = 600.0,
   fields(1:8,23) = 'LaHw2TH ','LaUH2TH ','LaUa2TH ',
